{"seq":2,"slug":"greenhouse-mechanism","title":"温室气体机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/greenhouse-mechanism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"co2-emissions","title":"CO₂排放与浓度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/greenhouse-mechanism/co2-emissions","wordCount":2253,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"methane-n2o","title":"甲烷与氧化亚氮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/greenhouse-mechanism/methane-n2o","wordCount":2453,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"measurement-monitoring","title":"监测与核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/greenhouse-mechanism/measurement-monitoring","wordCount":2973,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"温室气体机制\">温室气体机制</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>本章聚焦温室气体的排放源、大气浓度变化及监测核算体系。CO₂ 是最主要的人为温室气体，但 CH₄ 和 N₂O 因较高的全球增温潜势（GWP）同样不可忽视。精确的监测与核算是制定减排政策的数据基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>CO₂排放与浓度</td>\n<td>基林曲线、排放源、碳预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>甲烷与氧化亚氮</td>\n<td>CH₄/N₂O 来源、GWP、短寿命气候污染物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>监测与核算</td>\n<td>大气监测网络、卫星遥感、国家清单编制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>基林曲线（Keeling Curve）</strong>：1958年至今 Mauna Loa 的 CO₂ 连续观测记录</li>\n<li><strong>全球增温潜势（GWP）</strong>：衡量不同温室气体相对于 CO₂ 的增温能力</li>\n<li><strong>碳预算（Carbon Budget）</strong>：将升温控制在特定阈值内的剩余排放空间</li>\n</ul>\n"}